#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan {#overview}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is an experiment-agnostic Qiskit Function template for Hamiltonian dynamics. Given a 1D nearest-neighbor Pauli Hamiltonian, a prepared initial state (optional), and a set of observables, it runs Trotter time-evolution, approximate quantum compilation (AQC) circuit compression, and mitigated execution, then returns each observable's time series. Swap the setup (PRE) and the analysis (POST) and the same core drives a different experiment:\n"
msgstr "Ini ialah templat Qiskit Function yang agnostik eksperimen untuk dinamik Hamiltonian. Dengan input Hamiltonian Pauli jiran terdekat 1D, keadaan awal yang disediakan (pilihan), dan set observable, ia menjalankan evolusi masa Trotter, mampatan Circuit pengkompilan kuantum anggaran (AQC), dan pelaksanaan yang dimitigasi, kemudian mengembalikan siri masa bagi setiap observable. Tukar persediaan (PRE) dan analisis (POST) dan teras yang sama memacu eksperimen yang berbeza:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| PRE (your setup) | WORKFLOW (deployed here) | POST (your analysis) |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Prepare a state, as a circuit or a product state, with an optional local kick | Trotter synthesis &rarr; AQC compression &rarr; execution on `statevector`, `fake`, or `runtime`, returning $\\langle O \\rangle(t)$ | $S(q, \\omega)$ for neutron scattering, or magnetization, transport, quench dynamics, and so on |\n"
msgstr ""
"| PRE (persediaan anda) | WORKFLOW (dideploy di sini) | POST (analisis anda) |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Sediakan keadaan, sebagai litar atau keadaan produk, dengan tendangan tempatan pilihan | Sintesis Trotter &rarr; mampatan AQC &rarr; pelaksanaan pada `statevector`, `fake`, atau `runtime`, mengembalikan $\\langle O \\rangle(t)$ | $S(q, \\omega)$ untuk penyerakan neutron, atau kemagnetan, pengangkutan, dinamik quench, dan sebagainya |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The template is published in the [Qiskit Function templates repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter), alongside the other application templates. This notebook deploys it as a managed workflow on your IBM Quantum Platform instance. Run it once, and any notebook can then call the workflow with `client.load(\"aqc-dynamics-function\")`.\n"
msgstr "Templat ini diterbitkan dalam [repositori templat Qiskit Function](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter), bersama-sama templat aplikasi lain. Notebook ini mendeploynya sebagai managed workflow pada instans IBM Quantum Platform anda. Jalankan sekali, dan mana-mana notebook kemudian boleh memanggil workflow tersebut dengan `client.load(\"aqc-dynamics-function\")`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a worked scientific example, see [Simulate neutron scattering with an AQC + Trotter dynamics Serverless workflow](/tutorials/simulate-neutron-scattering-with-a-serverless-workflow), which calls this workflow to compute the dynamical structure factor of KCuF$_3$. This notebook covers deployment and the input contract instead.\n"
msgstr "Untuk contoh saintifik yang lengkap, lihat [Simulasikan penyerakan neutron dengan aliran kerja Serverless dinamik AQC + Trotter](/tutorials/simulate-neutron-scattering-with-a-serverless-workflow), yang memanggil aliran kerja ini untuk mengira faktor struktur dinamik KCuF$_3$. Notebook ini merangkumi deployment dan kontrak input sebaliknya.\n"

